      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Use the H3 REF2VA model, H3 video/audio VAEs, and minimax CLIP. Upload character, background and the full speech recording. Use consecutive ref_image_1..9 slots and <Picture N> prompt tags. All images remain referenced on every chunk. The source-audio latent is always locked; there are no audio-regeneration controls. The Exact Audio saver writes MKV with lossless float PCM audio: input AUDIO samples, channels and sample rate are preserved. This is the decoded audio, not the original compressed file bytes. Use a desktop player that supports MKV/PCM. Standard CreateVideo/SaveVideo can make MP4 instead, but AAC audio is re-encoded. Color/detail filters default OFF; to enable them connect appearance_reference containing the desired whole scene. See docs/ref2va-lipsync.md."
      ],
      "title": "Ref2VA lip sync with exact source audio"
    }
